{"id":"en_divorced-i-married-the-don","title":"Divorced, I Married the Don","titleEn":"Divorced, I Married the Don","description":"After her divorce left her with just thirty-two dollars, and her ex-husband's parting words dismissed her as worthless, she believed her life had ended. Then Enzo Moretti, described as New York's most feared mafia godfather, proposed an arrangement: marry him and look after his son in exchange for everything she needed. She accepted, treating it as a simple transaction. Yet when wealthy mothers humiliated her at school, he donated ten buildings; when a former classmate took credit for her work, he publicly declared she was his wife. For the first time, someone stood by her without letting her fall, and a boy who had been silent for years began calling her Mom. Her journey from thirty-two dollars to becoming the godfather's wife, from being cast aside to standing as a queen, shows that real","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/divorced-i-married-the-don/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/divorced-i-married-the-don/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbvzo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_divorced-i-married-the-don_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbvzo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divorced-i-married-the-don_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbvzo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divorced-i-married-the-don_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumbl